@CO	01-basics. Molecule coordinates: f=0 is R1's 5' base. Reads are 40 bp unless stated.
@CO	pair_overlap: 60 bp fragment chr1:41-100 (1-based). R1 fwd chr1:41-80, R2 rev chr1:61-100. True overlap f[20,40) = chr1:61-80, 20 bases.
@CO	pair_apart: 120 bp fragment chr1:101-220. R1 chr1:101-140, R2 chr1:181-220. No shared reference position, no overlap.
@CO	pair_overlap_3: 77 bp fragment chr1:41-117. Overlap f[37,40) = chr1:78-80, 3 bases (< --min-overlap 4).
@CO	single_end: flag 0, not paired. Every record counts as R1 (no 0x80), so there is no R2 to pair against.
@CO	mate_unmapped: R1 mapped; R2 flagged unmapped (0x4). Unmapped records are not planned.
@CO	with_secondary: pair_overlap again, plus a secondary (0x100) copy of R2 on chr2. Secondaries are not planned.
